# Testing

## Stack

- Web: Vitest + React Testing Library + Playwright
- Mobile: Jest + React Testing Library + Detox

## AAA Pattern

1. Arrange - Set up test data
2. Act - Execute code
3. Assert - Verify outcome

## Commands

- `pnpm test` - Run all
- `pnpm --filter [app] test` - Run specific

## Rules

- Test behavior, not implementation
- Accessible queries (getByRole, getByLabelText)
- Co-locate tests with components
- Coverage: 70%+ for components, 80%+ for packages

